     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Hen-Chao,<div><br></div><div>考慮使用 content 取出內文, 使用 grepl 判斷是否包括&quot;ErrPage.html&quot;字串.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-bTdJYD_7RUs/WSE2jgHSTgI/AAAAAAAALhs/IWU4h34LFZEKsZpvckZbP2Qo_IuTN-PlACLcB/s1600/httr%2Bpackage.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-bTdJYD_7RUs/WSE2jgHSTgI/AAAAAAAALhs/IWU4h34LFZEKsZpvckZbP2Qo_IuTN-PlACLcB/s1600/httr%252Bpackage.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237676343000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ugf7rp6PGJktaEWNyf0AK\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-bTdJYD_7RUs/WSE2jgHSTgI/AAAAAAAALhs/IWU4h34LFZEKsZpvckZbP2Qo_IuTN-PlACLcB/s400/httr%2Bpackage.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"378\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"># title: httr package<br></span># date: 2017.5.21</div></font></div></code></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div><br></div><div>library(httr)</div><div>x1 &lt;- &quot;<a href=\"http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/np.asp?CtNode=2144\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/np.asp?CtNode%3D2144&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237676343000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2pcaHDDfe7wqCov2OF0o9g\">http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/np.asp?CtNode=2144</a>&quot;</div><div>x2 &lt;- &quot;<a href=\"http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/njjp.asp?CtNode=21#E884\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/njjp.asp?CtNode%3D21%23E884&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237676343000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2r-4UBwAWn4mCUDS37xLuP\">http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/njjp.asp?CtNode=21#E884</a>&quot;</div><div>y1 &lt;- GET(x1)</div><div>y2 &lt;- GET(x2)</div></font></div></code></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div>y1;y2</div><div>grepl(&quot;ErrPage.html&quot;, content(y1, &quot;text&quot;)) # FALSE</div><div>grepl(&quot;ErrPage.html&quot;, content(y2, &quot;text&quot;)) # TRUE</div><div># end</div></font></div></code></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div>Hen-Chao Chang於 2017年5月17日星期三 UTC+8下午4時43分59秒寫道：</div></div>"
