     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Hen-Chao,<div><br></div><div>考慮使用 content 取出內文, 使用 grepl 判斷是否包括&quot;ErrPage.html&quot;字串.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-bTdJYD_7RUs/WSE2jgHSTgI/AAAAAAAALhs/IWU4h34LFZEKsZpvckZbP2Qo_IuTN-PlACLcB/s1600/httr%2Bpackage.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-bTdJYD_7RUs/WSE2jgHSTgI/AAAAAAAALhs/IWU4h34LFZEKsZpvckZbP2Qo_IuTN-PlACLcB/s1600/httr%252Bpackage.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237676348000&amp;usg=AOvVaw15Qdmy8xKuJbZ2_TI7_q_y\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-bTdJYD_7RUs/WSE2jgHSTgI/AAAAAAAALhs/IWU4h34LFZEKsZpvckZbP2Qo_IuTN-PlACLcB/s400/httr%2Bpackage.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"378\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"># title: httr package<br></span># date: 2017.5.21</div><div><br></div><div>library(httr)</div><div>x1 &lt;- &quot;<a href=\"http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/np.asp?CtNode=2144\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/np.asp?CtNode%3D2144&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237676348000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2cAy0WiPvZZeRQ3SwO6GpF\">http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/np.asp?CtNode=2144</a>&quot;</div><div>x2 &lt;- &quot;<a href=\"http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/njjp.asp?CtNode=21#E884\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/njjp.asp?CtNode%3D21%23E884&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237676348000&amp;usg=AOvVaw05lsJy257kxveeVBN_oNss\">http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/njjp.asp?CtNode=21#E884</a>&quot;</div><div>y1 &lt;- GET(x1)</div><div>y2 &lt;- GET(x2)</div><div>y1;y2</div><div>grepl(&quot;ErrPage.html&quot;, content(y1, &quot;text&quot;)) # FALSE</div><div>grepl(&quot;ErrPage.html&quot;, content(y2, &quot;text&quot;)) # TRUE</div><div># end</div></font></div></code></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div>Hen-Chao Chang於 2017年5月17日星期三 UTC+8下午4時43分59秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">請問如何讀取</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">list</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">內容？</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">請先看下面程式：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:red\">&gt; library(httr)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:red\">&gt; x1 &lt;-\r\n&quot;<a href=\"http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/np.asp?CtNode=2144\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/np.asp?CtNode%3D2144&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237676348000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2cAy0WiPvZZeRQ3SwO6GpF\">http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/np.asp?CtNode=2144</a>&quot;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:red\">&gt; x2 &lt;-\r\n&quot;<a href=\"http://www.dgbas.gov.tw/njjp.asp?CtNode=21#E884\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirectu